      <pubDate>Fri, 18 Sep 2026 17:22:05 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>America's “Main Street Millionaires” comprise about three million private business owners who have amassed one of the country's most concentrated pools of wealth. That's according to a study conducted by Owen Zidar and Eric Zwick.

